--- !u!114 &1817528373
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1817528372}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 651d75a0c40bc5a48be49d370230d750, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - 'Rosa:  I know I have lost my mind, but since you are here, I will play along.
    Who are you?'
  - 'Shadow:  I am the deepest and darkest suppressed part of your unconscious.'
  - 'Rosa:  You are my shadow.'
  - 'Shadow:  Precisely. '
  - 'Rosa:  I cannot take this anymore. How do I stop this torment? How do I find
    peace?'
  - 'Shadow:  Bare with me for a minute.'
  - 'Rosa:  Okay.'
  - 'Shadow:  Do you think the material world is a product of your consciousness
    and perception? Or do you think your consciousness and perception are products
    of the material world?'
  - 'Rosa:  Obviously the latter. My consciousness is the result of chemical reactions
    in my brain. Me being able to perceive the world is the result of information
    from my eyes, ears, hands etc. Those exist in an already existing material world.'
  - 'Shadow:   So if your existence is torment, the path forward would be to terminate
    your physical existence.'
  - 'Rosa:  You want me to...'
  - 'Shadow:  No, YOU want to'
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 1321229673}
  autoTrigger: 1
  player: {fileID: 1359140895}
  hasSpoken: 0
  X: -100
  Y: 13
  X2: 100
  Y2: 100
